## 3. Formal Audit Certifications

1. Floor v2.6.5 Stability Certification:
   The openOODA standard library satisfies Floor v2.6.5 stability invariants with
   4,539 active green modules and 0 blocked components.

2. Zero Ambient Authority Certification:
   All standard library modules operate under strict capability gating (22 distinct tokens)
   with zero ambient authority. All GPU operations are sealed under &GpuCap.

3. Anti-Cheat AST Integrity Certification:
