## 4. Step-by-Step Reproduction Guide

To independently reproduce and verify the openOODA standard library and governance framework:

```bash
# 1. Master Governance & Architectural Gate Verification (0 Violations)
cd /home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA
./openOODA/scripts/enforcer.oo.bin
./openOODA/scripts/verify_all.oo.bin
./openOODA/scripts/check_board.oo.bin

# 2. Master Dogfight E2E Verification Suite (322 Assertions)
python3 tests/run_tests.py

# 3. GPU ROCm/HIP Verification Suite (24 Suites / 120 Assertions)
./qa/tests_gpu/run_all_gpu_tests.oo.bin

# 4. Dogfight CLI Master Test Suite (47 Suites)
./qa/tests_dogfight/run_all_dogfight_tests.oo.bin
```

